    <!--
      Nearby 大厅 rows. They are declared here rather than in a layout because the lobby is a
      table-driven list: NearbyLobbyActivity builds one row per §2.2 field from a single table that
      pairs the label with the exact blocked reason that field is missing, and a row built in code
      needs a stable id for instrumentation to address. One id per row keeps that table the only
      place the field order is written down.
    -->
