    <!--
      The in-game status surface. D7: in local single-player there is no nearby status at all, so
      these ids must be absent from the run surface until a session exists — their presence is the
      bug, not their absence. D6: the states that demand user action live in a non-dismissible
      banner pinned to the top of the run surface, never inside the pause drawer, so a frozen end
      never has to open a drawer to recover.
    -->
